<title>INDONESIA: Texmaco Jaya 1996 net at 50.15 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Texmaco Jaya 1996 net at 50.15 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 1996</p>
<p>					 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income			  50.15	vs   42.05</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)    139	 vs    117</p>
<p>    Total operating revenue	495.47	vs  359.58</p>
<p>    Gross profit		     153.27	vs   104.49</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 127.91	vs    83.82</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		    74.39	vs    52.54</p>
<p>    Profit before minority</p>
<p>    interest			    50.15	vs    42.05</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		 77.82	vs    67.84</p>
<p>Note: The results were audited. PT Texmaco Jaya is a textile producer.</p>
</text>
